/drosophila-anatomy-developmental-ontology/issues/1621>)\n7268:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:CL_0000405 \"Obsoleted as the term seems completely unused in the literature.\")\n7269:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0000405 \"obsolete neuroepidermoblast\")\n7270:AnnotationAssertion(owl:deprecated obo:CL_0000405 \"true\"^^xsd:boolean)\n7272:# Class: obo:CL_0000406 (CNS short range interneuron)\n7274:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0000406 \"CNS short range interneuron\")\n7275:SubClassOf(obo:CL_0000406 obo:CL_0000099)\n7277:# Class: obo:CL_0000407 (scolopidial ligament cell)\n7279:AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"doi:10.1016/B978-0-12-408088-1.00002-6\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"doi:10.1023/a:1018564904170\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000407 \"A cell that anchors the cell body of a scolopidial neuron to the integument.\")\n7280:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0000407 \"scolopidial ligament cell\")\n7281:SubClassOf(obo:CL_0000407 obo:CL_0000378)\n7282:SubClassOf(obo:CL_0000407 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 obo:UBERON_0001038))\n7284:# Class: obo:CL_0000408 (male gamete)\n7286:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000408 \"BTO:0001277\")\n7287:AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000408 \"CALOHA:TS-0949\")\n7288:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0000408 \"male gamete\")\n7289:EquivalentClasses(obo:CL_0000408 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0000015 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0000053 obo:PATO_0001375) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002215 obo:GO_0009566)))\n7290:SubClassOf(Annotation(oboInOwl:is_inferred \"true\") obo:CL_0000408 obo:CL_0000015)\n7291:SubClassOf(Annotation(oboInOwl:is_inferred \"true\") obo:CL_0000408 obo:CL_0000300)\n7293:# Class: obo:CL_0000409 (obsolete scolopidial sheath cell)\n7295:AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0100001 obo:CL_0000409 obo:CL_0000382)\n7296:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment obo:CL_0000409 \"Obsoleted as this refers to the same cell type as 'scolopale cell'.\")\n7297:Ann